* cc2: supply step transient 3.25<->3.35V, RL=120k (worst compliance)
.inc models.inc
V1 ta 0 PULSE(3.25 3.35 4.999m 20u 20u 5m 10m)
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t sn 120k
Rk1 sn x 2
Vsm x dd 0
M1 dd g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Xop vset b ta 0 g opa333t
.tran 0 15m 1m 1u
.options method=gear
.end
